      "meaning": "Sant Eknath sings to Dnyaneshwar himself. Knowledge had gone dark in the world and nobody knew what was good for them, so Pandurang took birth and was named Dnyani - the one who knows. The gopikas stand with golden plates, Narad and Tumbar sing the Sama chant, and the secret is spoken openly: the whole universe was made of Brahman. The poet lays his head at those feet."
